WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.473
AI governance helps organizations manage AI responsibly by making AI use visible, accountable, risk-aware, and sustainable.

2
00:00:07.473 --> 00:00:22.001
Strong governance includes inventory, ownership, risk classification, policies, guardrails, evaluation, monitoring, change management, human oversight, incident response, and continuous improvement.

3
00:00:22.001 --> 00:00:27.698
Governance is not a replacement for organizational policy, official standards, or legal counsel.

4
00:00:27.698 --> 00:00:31.689
It is a practical operating model that helps teams make better decisions.

5
00:00:31.689 --> 00:00:33.894
The purpose is not to stop innovation.

6
00:00:33.894 --> 00:00:38.813
The purpose is to make AI use trustworthy enough to support real organizational goals.
